WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:14.000
Hello I'm Jens Bussman regional sales lead for Google Cloud in Germany, Austria and Switzerland.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The team and I support customers in the region.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.240
We help customers adopt technologies to make their business competitive for the digital future.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:32.400
Customers who are relying on us for this challenge are in all industries and of every size.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:38.560
For example, our close partner SAP and also companies like REWE Digital, Klöckner, Kärcher,

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:46.800
and Sovanta AG, which is the first company to use SAP HANA and Netweaver on Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.640
For the past 18 months the demand for GCP services in the region has increased exponentially.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:59.280
Our customers are looking forward to the start of the new cloud platform region in Frankfurt.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.440
Frankfurt has the highest density of data centers in Germany.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:13.120
This makes it the ideal location for customers to locate their cloud to provide the best possible performance.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:16.520
The new region in Frankfurt means speed for customer workloads.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:21.720
Our performance tests have shown a reduction in latency from 40% to 60%,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:25.500
compared to other nearby cloud platform regions.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.580
With the opening of the latest cloud platform in Frankfurt,

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.980
Google is your new neighbor, right next door.

